@startuml
title Sequence — generate timetable
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Admin browser" as P0
participant "Flask route" as P1
participant "Timetable adapter" as P2
participant "Engine / validator" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
P0 -> P1: POST /api/generate_timetable + session / CSRF
P1 -> P1: Check CSRF and admin session
P1 -> P2: engine_generate_timetable(institute_code)
P2 -> P4: Read institute, subjects, teachers, courses, settings
P4 --> P2: Academic data and constraints
P2 -> P2: Build time slots and session occurrences
P2 -> P3: generate(units, state)
note over P2, P3: Only when weekly requirements are valid
P3 --> P2: success, schedule, message, stats, diagnostics
P2 -> P3: TimetableValidator.audit(...)
note over P2, P3: Only after engine success
P3 --> P2: Audit result / errors
alt [generation and audit succeed]
P2 -> P4: Replace master rows; add SUCCESS history; commit
else [requirements / generation / audit fail]
P2 -> P4: Keep master; add FAILED history; commit
end
P2 --> P1: Result dictionary
P1 --> P0: HTTP 200 JSON; inspect success / status
@enduml
